1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,374
Running a team of AI agents? Agent Company turns it into a game you can play.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,877
Forge a character. Its class is its job.

3
00:00:08,877 --> 00:00:11,744
Its origin is the tool it runs on.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,836
Then fit the OpenProof harness: six limits it works within.

5
00:00:15,836 --> 00:00:18,200
No harness, no deployment.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Drag your team onto the map. Put someone in the wrong slot, and the map refuses.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,122
When the ring turns green, sound the horn.

8
00:00:28,122 --> 00:00:31,551
The orders are written straight into your repository.

9
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:36,883
Then the work runs down the line. Tests first, a challenger, an independent review.

10
00:00:36,883 --> 00:00:38,712
And only you merge.

11
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,517
When a quest comes back, no proof means no XP.

12
00:00:43,517 --> 00:00:47,705
An OpenProof evidence record seals it for full credit.

13
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,472
Every agent carries trust credits.

14
00:00:51,472 --> 00:00:54,093
Incidents cost the agent that caused them.

15
00:00:54,093 --> 00:00:56,743
Below fifteen, it is contained.

16
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,815
Play it in any world, or build your own.

17
00:01:04,815 --> 00:01:06,623
Even on your phone.

18
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:14,902
Agent Company. Free and open source, for any agent tool.
